@host = http://localhost:5000
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### Servis ayakta mi
GET {{api}}/ping
Accept: application/json

### Saglik kontrolu — veritabani ve Redis kontrolleri Gun 9'da eklenecek
GET {{host}}/health

### Kayit — basarili olursa access + refresh token doner
# @name register
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "deneme@loca.dev",
  "password": "Sifre1234",
  "fullName": "Deneme Kullanici",
  "phoneNumber": "+90 555 000 00 00"
}

### Giris
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "deneme@loca.dev",
  "password": "Sifre1234"
}

### Token'in sahibi kim (yetki gerektirir)
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Token yenileme — eski refresh token iptal edilir, yenisi verilir
# @name refresh
POST {{api}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Yeniden kullanim tespiti: yukaridaki istegi IKINCI kez calistir.
# Beklenen: 401 ve kullanicinin TUM oturumlarinin kapanmasi.
# Ardindan /auth/me de 401 donmeli.

### Cikis
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Yetkisiz erisim: token olmadan /me — 401 donmeli
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Tanimsiz yol: Problem Details formatinda 404 donmeli
GET {{api}}/olmayan-yol
Accept: application/json
